@startuml process-view
title Process view — startup, navigation, filtering

actor "User" as U
participant "Browser /\nReact" as B
participant "TanStack\nRouter" as R
participant "TanStack\nQuery Cache" as Q
participant "Sensing\nGarden API" as API
participant "Google\nMaps" as GM



U -> B : User enters Info/Edit page

B -> Q : useHubLocations (deploymentId)
Q -> API : GET /devices?deploymentId=...
API --> Q : Hubs with coordinates
Q --> B : Location data

note over B, GM
  On the Info and Edit tab, Google Maps
  JS SDK is loaded separately
  for map rendering
end note
B -> GM : load maps script
GM --> B : Map components
B -> GM : render markers (location data)
@enduml
